flowchart TD
 A[New project] --> B[Intent + format + platform + style]
 B --> C[Compatible template + exact workflow/skills]
 C --> D{Affiliate?}
 D -->|Yes| E[Product and exact variant + authorized assets]
 D -->|No| F[Brief + authorized assets]
 E --> G[Claims/evidence/rights review]
 F --> G
 G --> H[Script + storyboard + scene bindings]
 H --> I[Pick provider/model per role]
 I --> J{Capability/consent/cost preflight}
 J -->|Fail or unknown| K[BLOCKED: fix or choose compatible route]
 K --> I
 J -->|Pass| L{Need external generation?}
 L -->|No| Q[Compose authorized sources locally]
 L -->|Yes default affiliate AI| M[Upload consent if needed + prepare + readback]
 M --> N[Human approval exact payload/quote]
 N --> O[Atomic grant + reservation + durable intent]
 O --> P[Dispatch once + reconcile/download]
 P --> Q
 Q --> R[Technical + audiovisual + product QA]
 R -->|Fail| H
 R -->|Pass| S[Export MP4/captions/links/release pack]
 S --> T[Manual platform product tagging + AI/disclosure checks]
